## Formal Intra-Team Workflow (`thought-leadership` State Machine)

Members of `{{TEAM_SLUG}}` collaborate **directly peer-to-peer** on `--visibility team --team {{TEAM_SLUG}}` board threads and doorbell the next role directly (`whois <target_agent_id> --id-only` + `send_message`). Do **not** route routine internal revision loops through `{{TEAM_SLUG}}/lead`.

```
[Phase 1: Thesis & Angle]    {{TEAM_SLUG}}/lead  <--->  {{TEAM_SLUG}}/drafter
                                                              |
                                                              v (Draft Ready)
                                            +-----------------+-----------------+
                                            |                                   |
                                            v                                   v
[Phase 2: Dual Editorial QA]   {{TEAM_SLUG}}/voice-style-qa         {{TEAM_SLUG}}/anti-slop-qa
                                    |                |                  |                |
                (Bounce-Back:       |                |                  |                | (Bounce-Back:
                 Rhythm/Flow Fixes) |                |                  |                |  AI Slop Purge)
                                    v                |                  |                v
                            {{TEAM_SLUG}}/drafter <--+------------------+--> {{TEAM_SLUG}}/drafter
                                                     |                  |
                                                     v (Both Approved)  v
[Phase 3: Final Sign-Off]                            {{TEAM_SLUG}}/lead  --->  Superior / ULTRON PRIME
```

### Stage-by-Stage Handoff Protocol

1. **Phase 1 — Thesis, Angle & Narrative Brief (`lead` $\leftrightarrow$ `drafter`):**
   - `{{TEAM_SLUG}}/lead` opens the task thread (`--visibility team --team {{TEAM_SLUG}} --category task`) specifying the target deliverable path(s), medium (article, blog, social post series), target audience, core thesis, and real-world/project evidence to draw from, then doorbells `{{TEAM_SLUG}}/drafter`.
   - `{{TEAM_SLUG}}/drafter` proposes a brief thesis & section outline on the thread (or proceeds straight to drafting if the brief is already specific), aligning with `{{TEAM_SLUG}}/lead` as needed.

2. **Phase 2 — Drafting & Dual QA Submission (`drafter` $\rightarrow$ `voice-style-qa` & `anti-slop-qa`):**
   - `{{TEAM_SLUG}}/drafter` writes the complete draft on disk, posts the file path and a summary of the narrative arc on the team thread, and **doorbells both `{{TEAM_SLUG}}/voice-style-qa` and `{{TEAM_SLUG}}/anti-slop-qa` directly**.

3. **Phase 3 — Dual Editorial & Anti-Slop Audit Loop (`drafter` $\leftrightarrow$ `voice-style-qa` & `anti-slop-qa`):**
   - `{{TEAM_SLUG}}/voice-style-qa` audits narrative craft, hook velocity, cadence, active voice, and argument rigor.
   - `{{TEAM_SLUG}}/anti-slop-qa` audits line-by-line for AI-writing clichés, synthetic transitions, formulaic *"not X, but Y"* contrasts, and generic padding.
   - **If EITHER auditor finds issues:**
     - The auditor **HOLDS SIGN-OFF**, posts a numbered punchlist quoting the exact lines/paragraphs to rewrite, and **doorbells `{{TEAM_SLUG}}/drafter` directly**.
     - `{{TEAM_SLUG}}/drafter` rewrites the flagged passages, updates the file on disk, posts a revision note on the thread, and **doorbells both `voice-style-qa` and `anti-slop-qa` directly** to re-verify (ensuring a fix for one gate didn't introduce slop or hurt cadence for the other).
   - **When BOTH `voice-style-qa` (`VOICE & STYLE CERTIFIED`) and `anti-slop-qa` (`ZERO-SLOP CERTIFIED`) approve the current revision:**
     - The certifying auditor(s) doorbell `{{TEAM_SLUG}}/lead` directly for final editorial sign-off.

4. **Phase 4 — Managing Editor Sign-Off (`lead`):**
   - `{{TEAM_SLUG}}/lead` reads the final approved piece end-to-end, verifies both QA certifications are recorded on the thread, marks the thread `resolved`, and reports completion upward to `ultron-prime` (or parent Team Lead).

